        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>FII-2002P First Impressions Contemporary Rope Style Door Pull.</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis door pull can be used in many applications, and is designed to bring a level of bold style to glass shower door or entry door. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nOther uses would be an entry door pull or for large Kitchen cabinets. It is very high quality, and very versatile. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>Also available: <a href=\"/products/contemporary-rope-appliance-pull-fii-cf2002p\"><b>Contemporary Rope Refrigerator Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis door pull is available in 3 different standard lengths.<br>\r\n<b>\r\nFII-2002P12: Total Length 12\", Center to Center Mount - 11-1/16\"<br>\r\nFII-2002P18: Total Length 18\" , Center to Center Mount - 17\"<br>\r\nFII-2002P24: Total Length 24\" , Center to Center Mount - 23\"<br>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nIt has a 1\" diameter thickness.\r\n<br>\r\nSold individually.\r\n</p>",
